  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1405/298/310/172/9dd146729ba99fe2a4c8cfaec9fc3703cf54a397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"198\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>歡迎來到《哨兵頭 Southpoint 恐怖模組》</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>基岩版移植（注意：需啟用 Beta API）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/siren-head-southpoint-bedrock-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/siren-head-southpoint-bedrock-port</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:635px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HW3-sPC-DgM\" width=\"635\" height=\"374\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTgB_ER3Kqo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組支援單人與多人遊玩。進入不久後，你會聽到許多詭異的聲音，此時你已處於危險之中。本模組引入了「哨兵頭」&mdash;&mdash; 一種高大且具敵意的生物，它會追蹤獵殺你。它能發出各種聲音、移動迅速，並且能夠攀爬牆壁。當它靠近時，地面會微微震動，你的螢幕也會開始持續搖晃。模組中藏有諸多散落各地的秘密等待你去探索。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你主要的防禦手段是步槍：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">+ 按住滑鼠右鍵可啟動內建手電筒，提供足夠的光線讓你觀察周圍環境。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">+ 若你持有子彈，每發射擊都能擊暈目標並造成大量傷害。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">你可以在露營區找到這把步槍及其子彈。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">原版遊戲由 UndreamedPanic 製作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fundreamedpanic.itch.io%252fsirenhead-southpoint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://undreamedpanic.itch.io/sirenhead-southpoint</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">「哨兵頭」最初由 Trevor Henderson 創作：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/slimyswampghost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/slimyswampghost</a></span></p>",
